@startuml
title MaquiControl - Fleet Management Bounded Context\nDesign-Level Event Storming

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam rectangleFontSize 12
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam noteBorderColor #BDB76B
skinparam ArrowColor #555555

' ===== Actor -> Command -> Aggregate -> Domain Event =====
rectangle "COMMAND\nRegister Machinery" as CMD_REGISTER_MACHINERY #87CEFA
rectangle "AGGREGATE\nMachinery" as AGG_MACHINERY_0 #FFF59D
rectangle "DOMAIN EVENT\nMachinery Registered" as EVT_MACHINERY_REGISTERED #FFB74D
rectangle "ACTOR\nFleet Owner" as ACT_FLEET_OWNER_0 #FFF9C4
rectangle "COMMAND\nUpdate Machinery Information" as CMD_UPDATE_MACHINERY_INFORMATION #87CEFA
rectangle "AGGREGATE\nMachinery" as AGG_MACHINERY_1 #FFF59D
rectangle "DOMAIN EVENT\nMachinery Information Updated" as EVT_MACHINERY_INFORMATION_UPDATED #FFB74D
rectangle "ACTOR\nFleet Owner" as ACT_FLEET_OWNER_1 #FFF9C4
rectangle "COMMAND\nChange Machinery Status" as CMD_CHANGE_MACHINERY_STATUS #87CEFA
rectangle "AGGREGATE\nMachinery" as AGG_MACHINERY_2 #FFF59D
rectangle "DOMAIN EVENT\nMachinery Status Changed" as EVT_MACHINERY_STATUS_CHANGED #FFB74D
rectangle "COMMAND\nDeactivate Machinery" as CMD_DEACTIVATE_MACHINERY #87CEFA
rectangle "AGGREGATE\nMachinery" as AGG_MACHINERY_3 #FFF59D
rectangle "DOMAIN EVENT\nMachinery Deactivated" as EVT_MACHINERY_DEACTIVATED #FFB74D
rectangle "ACTOR\nFleet Owner" as ACT_FLEET_OWNER_3 #FFF9C4
rectangle "COMMAND\nRegister Category" as CMD_REGISTER_CATEGORY #87CEFA
rectangle "AGGREGATE\nCategory" as AGG_CATEGORY_4 #FFF59D
rectangle "DOMAIN EVENT\nCategory Registered" as EVT_CATEGORY_REGISTERED #FFB74D
rectangle "ACTOR\nFleet Owner" as ACT_FLEET_OWNER_4 #FFF9C4
rectangle "COMMAND\nRename Category" as CMD_RENAME_CATEGORY #87CEFA
rectangle "AGGREGATE\nCategory" as AGG_CATEGORY_5 #FFF59D
rectangle "DOMAIN EVENT\nCategory Renamed" as EVT_CATEGORY_RENAMED #FFB74D
rectangle "ACTOR\nFleet Owner" as ACT_FLEET_OWNER_5 #FFF9C4
rectangle "COMMAND\nDelete Category" as CMD_DELETE_CATEGORY #87CEFA
rectangle "AGGREGATE\nCategory" as AGG_CATEGORY_6 #FFF59D
rectangle "DOMAIN EVENT\nCategory Deleted" as EVT_CATEGORY_DELETED #FFB74D
rectangle "ACTOR\nFleet Owner" as ACT_FLEET_OWNER_6 #FFF9C4

' ===== Policies =====
rectangle "POLICY\nWhen machinery is registered,\nset its status to AVAILABLE" as POL_0 #B39DDB
rectangle "DOMAIN EVENT (Rental)\nReservation Confirmed" as XEVT_RESERVATION_CONFIRMED #FFE0B2
rectangle "POLICY\nWhen a reservation is confirmed,\nset the machinery to RESERVED" as POL_1 #B39DDB
rectangle "DOMAIN EVENT (Rental)\nReservation Cancelled" as XEVT_RESERVATION_CANCELLED #FFE0B2
rectangle "POLICY\nWhen a reservation is cancelled,\nset the machinery back to AVAILABLE" as POL_2 #B39DDB
rectangle "DOMAIN EVENT (Maintenance)\nMaintenance Started" as XEVT_MAINTENANCE_STARTED #FFE0B2
rectangle "POLICY\nWhen maintenance starts,\nset the machinery to IN_MAINTENANCE" as POL_3 #B39DDB
rectangle "DOMAIN EVENT (Maintenance)\nMaintenance Completed" as XEVT_MAINTENANCE_COMPLETED #FFE0B2
rectangle "POLICY\nWhen maintenance is completed,\nset the machinery back to AVAILABLE" as POL_4 #B39DDB

' ===== Read Models =====
rectangle "READ MODEL\nMachinery Catalog\n<size:10><i>Query: View Machinery Catalog</i></size>" as RM_0 #81C784
rectangle "ACTOR\nContractor" as ACT_RM_0 #FFF9C4
rectangle "READ MODEL\nMachinery Availability\n<size:10><i>Query: Check Machinery Availability</i></size>" as RM_1 #81C784
rectangle "ACTOR\nContractor" as ACT_RM_1 #FFF9C4
rectangle "READ MODEL\nCategory Catalog\n<size:10><i>Query: View Categories</i></size>" as RM_2 #81C784
rectangle "ACTOR\nFleet Owner" as ACT_RM_2 #FFF9C4
rectangle "HOTSPOT\nRegistration must respect the machinery\nlimit of the owner subscription plan" as HOT_0 #EF9A9A
rectangle "HOTSPOT\nAvailability may be outdated if\nstatus changes are not propagated" as HOT_1 #EF9A9A

ACT_FLEET_OWNER_0 --> CMD_REGISTER_MACHINERY
CMD_REGISTER_MACHINERY --> AGG_MACHINERY_0
AGG_MACHINERY_0 --> EVT_MACHINERY_REGISTERED
note bottom of AGG_MACHINERY_0
<b>Business rules (Machinery)</b>
- Name, brand and model are required
- Manufacture year must be valid
- Hourly rate (Money) cannot be negative
- Status: AVAILABLE, RESERVED, RENTED,
  IN_MAINTENANCE or OUT_OF_SERVICE
- Only AVAILABLE machinery can be reserved
end note
ACT_FLEET_OWNER_1 --> CMD_UPDATE_MACHINERY_INFORMATION
CMD_UPDATE_MACHINERY_INFORMATION --> AGG_MACHINERY_1
AGG_MACHINERY_1 --> EVT_MACHINERY_INFORMATION_UPDATED
CMD_CHANGE_MACHINERY_STATUS --> AGG_MACHINERY_2
AGG_MACHINERY_2 --> EVT_MACHINERY_STATUS_CHANGED
ACT_FLEET_OWNER_3 --> CMD_DEACTIVATE_MACHINERY
CMD_DEACTIVATE_MACHINERY --> AGG_MACHINERY_3
AGG_MACHINERY_3 --> EVT_MACHINERY_DEACTIVATED
ACT_FLEET_OWNER_4 --> CMD_REGISTER_CATEGORY
CMD_REGISTER_CATEGORY --> AGG_CATEGORY_4
AGG_CATEGORY_4 --> EVT_CATEGORY_REGISTERED
note bottom of AGG_CATEGORY_4
<b>Business rules (Category)</b>
- Name is required and unique
- A category with machinery
  cannot be deleted
end note
ACT_FLEET_OWNER_5 --> CMD_RENAME_CATEGORY
CMD_RENAME_CATEGORY --> AGG_CATEGORY_5
AGG_CATEGORY_5 --> EVT_CATEGORY_RENAMED
ACT_FLEET_OWNER_6 --> CMD_DELETE_CATEGORY
CMD_DELETE_CATEGORY --> AGG_CATEGORY_6
AGG_CATEGORY_6 --> EVT_CATEGORY_DELETED
EVT_MACHINERY_REGISTERED --> POL_0
POL_0 --> CMD_CHANGE_MACHINERY_STATUS
XEVT_RESERVATION_CONFIRMED --> POL_1
POL_1 --> CMD_CHANGE_MACHINERY_STATUS
XEVT_RESERVATION_CANCELLED --> POL_2
POL_2 --> CMD_CHANGE_MACHINERY_STATUS
XEVT_MAINTENANCE_STARTED --> POL_3
POL_3 --> CMD_CHANGE_MACHINERY_STATUS
XEVT_MAINTENANCE_COMPLETED --> POL_4
POL_4 --> CMD_CHANGE_MACHINERY_STATUS
EVT_MACHINERY_REGISTERED ..> RM_0 : updates
EVT_MACHINERY_INFORMATION_UPDATED ..> RM_0 : updates
EVT_MACHINERY_DEACTIVATED ..> RM_0 : updates
RM_0 ..> ACT_RM_0 : informs
EVT_MACHINERY_STATUS_CHANGED ..> RM_1 : updates
RM_1 ..> ACT_RM_1 : informs
EVT_CATEGORY_REGISTERED ..> RM_2 : updates
EVT_CATEGORY_RENAMED ..> RM_2 : updates
EVT_CATEGORY_DELETED ..> RM_2 : updates
RM_2 ..> ACT_RM_2 : informs
HOT_0 .. CMD_REGISTER_MACHINERY
HOT_1 .. EVT_MACHINERY_STATUS_CHANGED

legend right
|= Color |= Element |
|<#FFF9C4>| Actor |
|<#87CEFA>| Command |
|<#FFF59D>| Aggregate |
|<#FFB74D>| Domain Event |
|<#B39DDB>| Policy |
|<#81C784>| Read Model |
|<#FFE0B2>| Domain Event from another Bounded Context |
|<#EF9A9A>| Hotspot |
|<#FFFDE7>| Business Rules (note) |
endlegend

@enduml
